  "sentences": [
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "After class, our "
        },
        {
          "text": "group",
          "wordIds": [
            "group"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " gathers around a library table to work on an English "
        },
        {
          "text": "project",
          "wordIds": [
            "project"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "."
        }
      ],
      "translation": "下課後，我們小組圍坐在圖書館的桌子旁，一起進行英語專案作業。",
      "audio": {
        "src": "/audio/sentences/team-project/1.mp3",
